    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d889">

                <pb facs="0732" n="656" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg656"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7210</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Consul Edwards
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi></placeName>, <lb/>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-14T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 14, 1916, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Urgent. Department learns serious situation prevailing at Madera. Urgently
                    request adequate force be sent to that place for protection of foreigners
                    against bandits.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
